                <p class="project-tagline">Exam preparation platform for KEAM aspirants.</p>
                <p class="project-desc">Full-stack platform with practice tests, performance tracking, and curated study material — built with Hono and TypeScript on Postgres, deployed on Cloudflare.</p>
